#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#- Purpose  : README file for creation of .tif, .bif and .sim formatted 
#-            vectors from BusTalk code 
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Steps to create .bif and .sim formatted vectors from the BusTalk code (default)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
make <testname>

This will create testname.bif and testname.sim in the ./invec directory


Steps to create .tif formatted vectors from the BusTalk code
------------------------------------------------------------
- edit the config.h file and include the #define TIF
- setenv VECT_TYPE TIF from the unix command line
make <testname>

This will create testname.tif in the ./invec directory

Now, to return to .bif generation mode
- comment out the #define TIF in config.h
- unsetenv VECT_TYPE
- make <testname>
